n a result is missing close — either closes_error is set tool-wide, or this contract had no close in an otherwise-successful batch — fall back to quote.previous_close_price and tell the user the official close lookup is unavailable. When close.interpolated is true, surface close.date — the price is not from the requested day. Drop bid/ask when zero."}